<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108036" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπήνεμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sheltered from the wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				411
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					1.100
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.6.9
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσήνεμος, ἐκ τοῦ
			ὑπηνέμου</span> on <i>the lee-side,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				18.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπηνέμους ποιεῖσθαι τὰς
				νεοττεύσεις</span> to make the nests <i>in sheltered
				places,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				559a3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὑπηνέμοις</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποις</span>) ib.<i><span class="en">
				568b26
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>gentle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>swift as the wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.54
			</span></i>; epith. of Mars, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				2.81
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			= foreg. <i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθυμίαι, δόξαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				20.24
			</span></i> codd., <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				2.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
